          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lok ki jo Icrael ci igam odoo ki botgi, odoo acel pi dog ot pa kwarogi acel acel. Gam ki bot lutel wigi ducu, ma oporo dog odi pa kwarogi, odoo ducu apar wiye aryo. Co nyiŋ dano acel acel i kom odoone, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci ico nyiŋ Aron i kom odoo pa likwayo pa Levi; pien ludito wi kaka ki i dog odi pa kwarogi gibibedo ki odoogi acel acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibicibogi i kema me rwatte i nyim canduk lok me caden ka ma arwatte iye kwedwu-ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci odoo pa dano ma abiyero en aye bilot. Meno aye abinoŋo iye yo me juko jo Icrael ma gibedo ka nur i koma-ni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses oloko ki jo Icrael, ci lutel wigi ducu gukelo odoo bote, odoo acel pi lutel wigi acel acel, ma oporo wel odi pa kwarogi, odoo apar wiye aryo; odoo pa Aron bene onoŋo tye i kin odoogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Moses ocibo odoo ducu i nyim Rwot i kema lok me caden.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
