          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 9.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwone Moses odonyo i kema lok me caden; ci, nen, odoo pa Aron ma ocuŋ pi dog ot pa Levi-ni aye olot woko, ocako kico bolo olaŋ, ci oturo ture onyako nyig yaa mucek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Moses okelo odoo ducu nia ki i nyim Rwot, otero bot jo Icrael ducu, guneno, ci dano acel acel okwanyo odoone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Dwok odoo pa Aron i nyim canduk lok me caden kakare, wek gigwok obed lanyut pi jo mujemo, wek ijuk ki nurgi atata i koma, ogik woko, wek pe to opot i komgi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses otimo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci jo Icrael guwaco bot Moses ni, “Nen ba, watum woko do, keckom opoto i komwa omiyo wato, wato woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ducu ma gibino cok, ma gibino cok ki kema pa Rwot, gito woko. Wan ducu myero wato woko bo?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
